1
00:00:45,168 --> 00:00:49,480
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,505 --> 00:00:51,377
=Episode 24=

3
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,399
Why?

4
00:00:56,159 --> 00:00:56,960
It is impossible.

5
00:01:00,159 --> 00:01:01,920
He's nothing

6
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,920
but a mere fragment of me.

7
00:01:11,519 --> 00:01:12,319
Ziyan,

8
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:16,159
I've used the last of my strength.

9
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:16,959
Ridiculous.

10
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,480
Ziyan,

11
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:26,319
I burned my life to hold him still.

12
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,640
You?

13
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:30,815
Fight me for this body?

14
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:31,640
Chi Xiao?

15
00:01:31,943 --> 00:01:32,634
Do it now!

16
00:01:32,659 --> 00:01:33,319
Chi Xiao!

17
00:01:33,344 --> 00:01:34,879
Use the Wind God Chronicle

18
00:01:34,998 --> 00:01:36,319
to extract the Divine Stone!

19
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:38,280
Hurry!

20
00:01:38,519 --> 00:01:39,319
Die!

21
00:01:40,052 --> 00:01:41,200
Foolish.

22
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:42,560
Ah!

23
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,321
Ziyan!

24
00:01:43,346 --> 00:01:44,280
Die!

25
00:01:44,506 --> 00:01:45,799
Ah!

26
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:46,640
Ah!

27
00:01:47,445 --> 00:01:48,406
How absurd.

28
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:56,319
(Chi Xiao, you should smile more often.)

29
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:57,719
(Mm.)

30
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:58,959
(That's better.)

31
00:02:01,226 --> 00:02:02,026
(Mm.)

32
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:04,120
(Ah.)

33
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,879
(Look, Chi Xiao.)

34
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:06,560
(Hmph.)

35
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,000
(Will you?)

36
00:02:35,759 --> 00:02:36,319
(Ah.)

37
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:39,719
Ziyan,

38
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,919
if there is a next life,

39
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,159
I hope

40
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,719
I'll be the one who meets you first.

41
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,360
Chi Xiao!

42
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:57,680
Chi Xiao!

43
00:03:03,639 --> 00:03:04,319
Ziyan!

44
00:03:04,625 --> 00:03:05,465
Hurry!

45
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:06,400
Hurry!

46
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:09,532
Use the Wind God Chronicle
to pull out the Divine Stone!

47
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,319
Hurry!

48
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:11,840
Die!

49
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,199
Die!

50
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,120
Wind God, return!

51
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:30,039
Stone, emerge!

52
00:04:28,333 --> 00:04:29,213
It is over.

53
00:04:58,879 --> 00:05:00,240
Hahaha!

54
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,279
I have awaited

55
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,879
this very moment for ages.

56
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,839
I've done it.

57
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,319
How are you still alive?

58
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:25,720
The Twin Hands

59
00:05:26,479 --> 00:05:28,079
are my true body.

60
00:05:29,565 --> 00:05:31,319
As long as the hands live, I live.

61
00:05:31,925 --> 00:05:33,480
Parasitic in all things.

62
00:05:35,045 --> 00:05:36,086
I have now

63
00:05:36,146 --> 00:05:37,706
merged with the Demon God,

64
00:05:37,853 --> 00:05:39,452
Hundun.

65
00:05:41,953 --> 00:05:44,633
Once I absorb your Wind God power,

66
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:47,020
I'll break free
from the cycle of rebirth.

67
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,160
Greater

68
00:05:50,346 --> 00:05:51,546
than any god.

69
00:05:54,633 --> 00:05:55,633
You ants.

70
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:56,920
Challenge me?

71
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:00,959
Hmph!

72
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,079
Hahaha!

73
00:06:04,940 --> 00:06:05,819
If we cannot live together,

74
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,879
then we die together.

75
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,240
Yuanzhen Art.

76
00:06:11,264 --> 00:06:12,544
Seal the sky with our lives.

77
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,040
Hmph!

78
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:23,399
A futile resistance.

79
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:25,879
Once your Qi runs out

80
00:06:26,225 --> 00:06:27,706
and your hearts are destroyed,

81
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:31,399
you'll never be reborn.

82
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:36,240
Hmph!

83
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,519
Yuanchu,

84
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,600
is there something
you still haven't told me?

85
00:06:52,546 --> 00:06:53,585
In your mortal world,

86
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:57,086
you still owe me

87
00:06:57,087 --> 00:06:59,040
one proper "wife."

88
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:01,639
Then I

89
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,839
will call you that
for the rest of my life.

90
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,720
My wife.

91
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,280
My husband.

92
00:07:26,946 --> 00:07:28,618
Disgusting.

93
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,600
You all die!

94
00:07:54,259 --> 00:07:55,060
This is...

95
00:07:56,512 --> 00:07:57,993
My Thousand-Fold Love Ordeal

96
00:07:58,545 --> 00:07:59,946
inside the Wind God Chronicle.

97
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,399
Yuanchu,

98
00:08:18,858 --> 00:08:19,946
actually,

99
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,759
I've loved you a thousand times too.

100
00:08:43,978 --> 00:08:45,900
Your Wind God Chronicle is complete.

101
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:49,980
And my Wind God power

102
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,200
has returned.

103
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:54,480
In the Love Ordeal,

104
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:57,000
I made the same choice you did.

105
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,320
So this is it.

106
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,559
Heart and soul as one.

107
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,039
Love gives life to love.

108
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:04,759
That's the true way to break the Ordeal.

109
00:09:13,186 --> 00:09:15,039
If I can't have any of it...

110
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:19,960
Hahaha!

111
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,440
Then I'll tear this sky apart

112
00:09:25,879 --> 00:09:27,159
and turn it into hell.

113
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,799
All beings

114
00:09:33,799 --> 00:09:35,799
share the same doom!

115
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,519
The Sky Rift is tearing open.

116
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:54,360
Even if we mend it with the Stone now,

117
00:09:54,756 --> 00:09:56,416
it may be too late.

118
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:58,960
The sky

119
00:10:00,665 --> 00:10:02,552
won't hold much longer.

120
00:10:07,799 --> 00:10:09,720
If this world is doomed to end,

121
00:10:10,453 --> 00:10:12,052
then I'll race against the heavens.

122
00:10:12,479 --> 00:10:13,839
Every extra glance at you

123
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:15,940
is a gift for me.

124
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,440
That's enough.

125
00:10:21,866 --> 00:10:24,545
Until the very last moment of life,

126
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:27,120
with you by my side,

127
00:10:28,692 --> 00:10:30,133
that is forever.

128
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:42,240
Hahaha!

129
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,039
In the end,

130
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,600
it was I

131
00:10:51,146 --> 00:10:53,126
who defeated myself.

132
00:10:55,965 --> 00:10:57,039
If that's how it is,

133
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,720
then I'll help Chi Xiao

134
00:11:01,686 --> 00:11:03,432
fulfill his last wish.

135
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:05,480
Sure.

136
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,919
You two play heroes and leave me out?

137
00:11:09,393 --> 00:11:12,072
Don't forget, you've still got

138
00:11:12,365 --> 00:11:13,445
your senior!

139
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,720
All lights converge.

140
00:12:06,039 --> 00:12:07,480
Mend the sky, restore the earth.

141
00:12:07,504 --> 00:12:09,231
Sun, moon and stars,

142
00:12:09,255 --> 00:12:11,054
stand firm, never shifting.

143
00:13:08,112 --> 00:13:09,345
The sky is mended.

144
00:14:17,159 --> 00:14:18,055
Master.

145
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:20,100
Those who mended the sky,

146
00:14:20,500 --> 00:14:21,919
why do they have no names?

147
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:24,720
Because they share one name.

148
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,279
Hunter.

149
00:14:26,759 --> 00:14:27,200
Then

150
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:30,226
did Shangguan Ziyan and Yuanchu
die in the end?

151
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:36,320
The Divine Stone blooms,

152
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,159
love bears fruit,

153
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,559
and life goes on.

154
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:41,734
Hmm.

155
00:14:41,759 --> 00:14:43,140
I do not understand.

156
00:14:43,879 --> 00:14:44,440
Then,

157
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,840
if there are no more demons
in this world,

158
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,698
why should I still learn the arts?

159
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:52,799
Hunting demons

160
00:14:52,919 --> 00:14:54,960
isn't just about the ones in the wild,

161
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:57,200
but the ones

162
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,840
in people's hearts of this world.

163
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,266
Understood.

164
00:15:10,300 --> 00:15:15,439
♪Beneath the boundless sky,
I turn toward the break of dawn♪

165
00:15:16,306 --> 00:15:17,726
♪I look back on this mortal world♪

166
00:15:17,759 --> 00:15:23,593
♪Fading traces of a fragile life,
lost in a dream♪

167
00:15:23,618 --> 00:15:27,726
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

168
00:15:27,853 --> 00:15:30,699
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

169
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:35,453
Yuanlang.

170
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,213
Senior.

171
00:15:37,866 --> 00:15:40,179
♪Let the wind sweep away♪

172
00:15:40,203 --> 00:15:45,277
♪This heavy air of sorrow♪

173
00:15:45,326 --> 00:15:47,386
♪Do not forget the tangled paths♪

174
00:15:47,413 --> 00:15:52,406
♪That you and I have crossed♪

175
00:15:52,966 --> 00:15:56,633
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

176
00:15:56,657 --> 00:16:00,543
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

177
00:16:00,566 --> 00:16:06,513
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪

178
00:16:30,272 --> 00:16:34,200
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

179
00:16:34,472 --> 00:16:37,645
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

180
00:16:37,686 --> 00:16:41,318
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

181
00:16:41,343 --> 00:16:44,320
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

182
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,950
♪Let the wind sweep away♪

183
00:16:46,950 --> 00:16:51,814
♪This heavy air of sorrow♪

184
00:16:52,016 --> 00:16:58,704
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

185
00:16:59,610 --> 00:17:03,280
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

186
00:17:03,390 --> 00:17:07,080
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

187
00:17:07,248 --> 00:17:13,477
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
